# Contention instrumentation for ALEX-OL.
#
# Adds counters on the two places an insert can be turned away under concurrency:
#   retry      - the insert path restarts because the structure was mid-modification
#   parentspin - one iteration of the spin acquiring the parent node's lock
# plus the earlier lock/validation counters, which an insert-only workload never reaches.
#
# Counters are thread-local with a registry, so counting generates no coherence traffic
# and cannot manufacture the contention it measures. Build with -DLOCK_STATS and pass
# 'lockstats' to the driver.
#
# Applies on top of alexol-stagger.patch.
